B.as9=new A.oy("CLASSIC FIRST GUESS","Can you crack the answer before the clues give it away? Work your way through ten clues, from tricky to easy. You have three lives, one guess per clue, and the option to skip if you are unsure.\n\nSCORING: Earn 100 XP for solving on Clue One, dropping by 10 XP with each new clue. Get it right on your very first guess at Clue One and bag an extra 50 XP First Guess bonus \u2014 that\u2019s 150 XP!",null)
B.asa=new A.oy("FIRST WORD","Five clues. One mystery word. Can you solve it before the letters give it away? You have just three guesses across the entire challenge, with more letters revealed as you progress.\n\nSCORING: Earn 100, 80, 60, 40 or 20 XP depending on which clue you solve it on. Crack the word with your first guess at Clue One and collect an extra 50 XP First Guess bonus \u2014 150 XP in total!",null)
B.as6=new A.oy("FIRST DATE","Travel through time and connect the dots! Ten events all share one year or month. Study the clues and work out the date that links them together.\n\nSCORING: Start with 100 XP on Clue One, losing 10 XP with each additional clue. Solve it on your first guess at Clue One for an extra 50 XP First Guess bonus \u2014 a maximum of 150 XP!",null)
